        "readable_text": "Prompt:\nCalculate [MATH: (dy)/(dx)] for [MATH: y = \\log_{2} (sqrt(x)).]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: (1)/(2x\\ln 2)]\nb. [MATH: (1)/(x\\ln 2)]\nc. [MATH: (1)/(2sqrt(x)\\ln 2)]\nd. [MATH: (1)/(2x)]\ne. [MATH: (1)/(sqrt(x)\\ln 2)]"
